      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "あんたのお陰で、無事に孫が戻って来た。\n心配したわい、本当にすまんかったな！\nちょっと目を離すとすぐどっかへ行くんじゃ……\nま、ワシも若い頃はそうじゃったがな。",
        "official_en": "Thanks to you, my granddaughter is home safe.\nI know if I take my eyes off that one for even a\nsecond, she'll be right out the door again. *sigh*\nI suppose she gets her wild side from me, after all...",
